Subject: [PATCH 06/27] prime: weight the sovereignty score by independence,
 not just LZT1

A proxy can sign a valid attestation, so verified-alone scored 100 while
the fake-DATUM builder was flagged. Discount flagged, pool-clustered and
unknown builders; publish verified_share beside the score.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
